  {
   "text": "Agreed to an interview with a journalist and when I showed up on the Zoom he asked if he could record for his notes (I said sure) and then WITHOUT asking he fired up his AI note taking agent (otter-ai) as a third Zoom participant and I did the interview anyway but wow it felt gross",
