   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "On CNBC’s Squawk Box at 7:50am ET talking about the AI bubble, NVIDIA’s No IT Loads Refused $500 Billion Infrastructure fund, and how the future of hyperscaler growth is dependent on Anthropic and OpenAI paying them over a hundred billion dollars in 2027 alone.",
