   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "🤯 An Nvidia Jetson microcomputer was found in Russia's new S-71 \"Monochrom\" missile with AI technology, according to the Ukrainian intelligence portal War&Sanctions.\n\nIn total, experts identified 35 new foreign components in Russian weaponry.",
   "handle": "united24media.com",
