   "external": "",
   "query": "NVIDIA AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "ad blockers are good because being able to use whatever client you want, a news reader, browser, plugins, addons, scripts, curl, ai agent, whatever, is a basic necessity of personal computing.\n\nit is my computer, you do not get to tell me what i can do with it.",
